{"seq":8,"slug":"mathematical-logic","title":"数理逻辑与形式化方法","stage":"DONE","category":"mathematics-statistics","chapterCount":4,"docCount":16,"url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/mathematical-logic","rating":{"composite":3.68,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.37,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 数理逻辑与形式化方法 简介\n\n数理逻辑是用数学方法研究推理本身的学科，它为\"什么是正确的推理\"这一根本问题提供了精确的数学答案。形式化方法则将数理逻辑的工具应用于软件和硬件的正确性验证，确保系统按照规约运行。对程序员而言，数理逻辑不仅是理解类型系统、程序验证和自动化推理的理论基础，更是提升逻辑思维和抽象能力的重要训练。\n\n本知识库面向具有编程经验和基本数学素养、希望系统掌握数理逻辑核心理论并了解形式化方法实践的中级程序员。如果你想理解 SAT 求解器为什么能高效工作、哥德尔不完备定理意味着什么、或者模型检查如何保证软件的正确性，本知识库将为你提供从基础到应用的完整路径。\n\n第1章**命题逻辑**建立形式推理的基础框架，讲解命题逻辑的语法与语义、真值表与范式、命题演绎以及 SAT 问题，帮助你掌握最基本的形式推理工具。\n\n第2章**谓词逻辑**将命题逻辑扩展到更强大的表达能力，讲解一阶逻辑的语法语义、量词与推理规则、完备性定理以及可判定性问题，这是形式化规约和自动化定理证明的理论核心。\n\n第3章**证明论**从证明本身的结构入手，讲解自然演绎、相继式演算、哥德尔不完备定理以及构造性逻辑，帮助你理解\"证明\"的数学本质以及形式系统的能力边界。\n\n第4章**模型论与形式验证**将数理逻辑应用于实际的软件和硬件验证，讲解模型论基础、形式规约、模型检查和程序验证等核心技术，展示逻辑学如何保障关键系统的正确性。\n\n建议学习路径为：前两章是理论基础，应按顺序扎实学习；第三章偏向数学理论的深度，适合对逻辑学有浓厚兴趣的读者；第四章偏向工程应用，适合关注软件质量和可靠性的读者。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"propositional-logic","title":"命题逻辑","docCount":4,"url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/mathematical-logic/propositional-logic","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"syntax-semantics","title":"语法与语义","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/mathematical-logic/propositional-logic/syntax-semantics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"truth-tables-normal-forms","title":"真值表与范式","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/mathematical-logic/propositional-logic/truth-tables-normal-forms"},{"seq":3,"slug":"propositional-deduction","title":"命题演绎","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/mathematical-logic/propositional-logic/propositional-deduction"},{"seq":4,"slug":"sat-problem","title":"SAT 问题","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/mathematical-logic/propositional-logic/sat-problem"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"predicate-logic","title":"谓词逻辑","docCount":4,"url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/mathematical-logic/predicate-logic","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"first-order-logic","title":"一阶逻辑","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/mathematical-logic/predicate-logic/first-order-logic"},{"seq":2,"slug":"quantifiers-inference","title":"量词与推理","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/mathematical-logic/predicate-logic/quantifiers-inference"},{"seq":3,"slug":"completeness-theorem","title":"完备性定理","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/mathematical-logic/predicate-logic/completeness-theorem"},{"seq":4,"slug":"decidability","title":"可判定性","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/mathematical-logic/predicate-logic/decidability"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"proof-theory","title":"证明论","docCount":4,"url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/mathematical-logic/proof-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"natural-deduction","title":"自然演绎","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/mathematical-logic/proof-theory/natural-deduction"},{"seq":2,"slug":"sequent-calculus","title":"相继式演算","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/mathematical-logic/proof-theory/sequent-calculus"},{"seq":3,"slug":"incompleteness-theorems","title":"不完备性定理","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/mathematical-logic/proof-theory/incompleteness-theorems"},{"seq":4,"slug":"constructive-logic","title":"构造性逻辑","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/mathematical-logic/proof-theory/constructive-logic"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"model-theory-verification","title":"模型论与形式验证","docCount":4,"url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/mathematical-logic/model-theory-verification","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"model-theory-basics","title":"模型论基础","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/mathematical-logic/model-theory-verification/model-theory-basics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"formal-specification","title":"形式化规约","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/mathematical-logic/model-theory-verification/formal-specification"},{"seq":3,"slug":"model-checking","title":"模型检测","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/mathematical-logic/model-theory-verification/model-checking"},{"seq":4,"slug":"program-verification","title":"程序验证","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/mathematical-logic/model-theory-verification/program-verification"}]}]}